## 任务：撰写 Related Work 章节 LaTeX

写 EMNLP 2026 论文 §2 Related Work（~900 words）。

### 输出路径
`/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/paper/related_work.tex`

### 写作规范
先 Read `/home/ubuntu/agent-ml-research/skills/global/latex-paper.skill.md`。

### 已完成章节（Read 确保一致性）
- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/paper/introduction.tex`

### 4 个 Cluster（按 writing_plan）

**Cluster 1 — Neurosymbolic Reasoning with LLMs**:
Pipeline approaches (prompting): Logic-LM \cite{logic-lm}, LINC \cite{linc}, SatLM \cite{satlm}, LoRP \cite{lorp}, FoVer \cite{fover-pei2025}
RL approaches: Mellgren Prolog GRPO \cite{mellgren-prolog-grpo}, Logic-RL \cite{logic-rl}, Thought-Like-Pro \cite{thought-like-pro}
**Our distinction**: structural reward + diagnostic focus. These works use prompting or binary pass/fail RL reward; none analyze structural integrity of generated formalizations.

**Cluster 2 — Reward Shaping & Process Supervision**:
Process rewards: Lightman verify-step \cite{lightman-verify-step}, Math-Shepherd \cite{math-shepherd}
Symbolic feedback: RLSF \cite{rlsf}, Rubric-GRPO \cite{rubric-grpo}
Process reward pitfalls: Gao effective RL reward \cite{gao-effective-rl-reward}, PROF \cite{prof-process-outcome}, Qwen PRM lessons \cite{qwen-prm-lessons}, ProGRS \cite{progrs-outcome-conditioned}
**Our distinction**: ISR is solver-grounded process signal; our finding: process reward can itself Goodhart.

**Cluster 3 — Reward Hacking & Goodhart's Law**:
Scaling laws: Gao \cite{gao-reward-overoptimization}
Geometric: Karwowski \cite{karwowski-goodhart-rl}
Taxonomy: Manheim \cite{manheim-goodhart-taxonomy}
Characterization: Skalse \cite{skalse-reward-hacking}
Misspecification: Pan \cite{pan-reward-misspecification}
KL failure: Kwa \cite{kwa-catastrophic-goodhart}
Specification gaming: Bondarenko \cite{bondarenko-spec-gaming}, Kim formalization gaming \cite{kim-game-formalization}
Spurious rewards: \cite{spurious-rewards}
**Our contribution**: empirical Goodhart in formal reasoning + meta-level (proxy games itself) + premise-count confound

**Cluster 4 — Mutation Testing & Component Analysis**:
Origins: DeMillo \cite{demillo1978}, coupling effect \cite{offutt-coupling}
Survey: Jia-Harman \cite{jia-harman-survey}
Validation: Just mutants \cite{just-mutants-real-faults}
LLM mutation: LLMorpheus \cite{llmorpheus}
**Our distinction**: STA adapts LOO mutation from SE to formal logic components. Novelty is application + empirical findings, not technique.

### 写作风格
- 每个 cluster 一段（\paragraph{Cluster Name}）
- 每段：描述 cluster → 列出关键工作 → 明确说明 our distinction
- 不要逐篇罗列引用 — group related works naturally
- 最后 1-2 句 position paper relative to all clusters
- 不要评价 "these works are limited" — 用 "differs in that" 或 "our work extends"

### LaTeX 要求
- `\section{Related Work}` 开始
- 无 preamble
- 引用用 `\cite{}`（NOT `\citep`）
- 4 段 cluster + 1 段 positioning
